# Python FastAPI Best Practices — Web Application [Frontend]

### Project Overview
Product Context: I am building an AI-powered tele-dermatology and medicine fulfillment frontend.

Workflow:
**User Submission:** Patient submits a questionnaire with skin/hair photos and videos.
**AI Diagnosis:** Backend runs inputs asynchronously through a local Vision-LLM (Ollama) to generate a diagnosis.
**Paywall:** User sees a blurred preview, pays a consultation fee to unlock full findings, and triggers a doctor review.
**Doctor Review:** Doctor gets notified (Push/SMS/WhatsApp) to Accept (customizes medicine kit), Reject (triggers auto-refund), or Request Info (user resubmits).
**Fulfillment:** Approved user pays for the kit => triggers third-party logistics API for delivery.

## Overview of the codebase and frontend (web)
This repository hosts the **Frontend Web Application**, which acts as B2C channel for end users.
It owns and manages:
- **Authentication:** Sign UP / Login
- **Homepage:** Showing about the products (skin, hair) and about the introduction to the product and company
- **Questionnaire Submissions:** Step by step approach to select and submission of questions to backend
- **Diagnosis Purchase:** After diagnosis done by AI, user can purchase the full diagnosis by buying the product
- **Doctor Verification:** Once diagnosis is done by AI and user pays for the full diagnosis, user can see the option of assigned doctors who will write the prescription
- **Prescriptions & Medicine Kits:** User can see the prescription and after that have option to buy the medicine kit

### Consult Statuses (From starting questionnnaire to kit delivery)
- `CREATED` — consult created
- `QUESTIONNAIRE_SUBMITTED` — questionnaire response saved
- `DRAI_DG_PENDING` — queued for AI diagnosis
- `DRAI_DG_PROCESSING` — AI diagnosis running
- `DRAI_DG_DIAGNOSED` — AI diagnosis complete
- `DRAI_DG_PAYMENT_PENDING` — waiting for diagnosis unlock payment
- `DRAI_DG_PAYMENT_SUCCESS` — diagnosis payment succeeded
- `DRAI_DG_PAYMENT_FAILED` — diagnosis payment failed
- `DR_DG_PENDING` — awaiting doctor diagnosis review
- `DR_DG_APPROVED` — doctor approved diagnosis
- `DR_DG_REJECTED` — doctor rejected diagnosis
- `DRAI_KIT_PROCESSING` — AI kit assembly in progress
- `DRAI_KIT_PROCESSED` — AI kit ready
- `DR_KIT_PENDING` — awaiting doctor kit confirmation
- `DR_KIT_CREATED` — doctor confirmed/created kit
